{"sourceUrl":"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/2025/0808/c17770a376225/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:20.183096+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/2025/0808/c17770a376225/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><a href=\"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/2025/0808/c17770a376225/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/2025/0808/c17770a376225/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/2025/0808/c17770a376225/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>为促进跨学科交流、激发学术创新，哈工大苏州研究院</span><span><span>联合华为技术有限公司</span></span><span>于</span></span></span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span><span>-22</span><span><span><span>日举办“学术前沿探索”主题夏令营。</span><span>本次活动聚焦电子信息、机械、材料化工、能源动力、土木水利五大领域，特邀高水平学者作学术报告、为营员搭建分享交流平台。欢迎拟申请攻读哈尔滨工业大学苏州专项专业学位直博生的同学踊跃报名。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>一、哈工大苏州研究院简介</span></strong></p><p><span><span>哈工大苏州研究院是苏州市政府和哈尔滨工业大学共建的哈工大在长三角地区唯一的综合性研究院。围绕长三角地区和苏州“</span></span><span>1030”</span><span><span><span><span>产业体系</span></span><span><span>，以立德树人为根本任务，以服务国家战略和行业高端人才需求为宗旨，以向区域重点领域输送思正、品端、赋有工匠精神和创造激情，敢为人先的高水平工程技术人才为目标，以实践创新能力培养为重点，强化企业出题师生答题的产教融合育人机制，开展校企联合培养专业学位工程硕士博士研究生，为国家为区域重点领域输送具备解决复杂工程问题和技术创新能力的高层次工程领军人。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、华为技术有限公司简介</span></span></strong></p><p><a href=\"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/2025/0808/c17770a376225/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/2025/0808/c17770a376225/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>华为技术有限公司创立于</span></span><span>1987</span><span><span>年，是全球领先的</span></span><span>ICT</span><span><span>（信息与通信）基础设施和智能终端提供商，业务遍及</span></span><span>170</span><span><span>多个国家和地区。公司愿景是将数字世界带入每个人、每个家庭、每个组织，构建万物互联的智能世界。华为苏州研究所是华为公司在苏州设立的一个研发基地，成立于</span></span><span>2012</span><span><span>年，是华为全球研发体系中的重要组成部分。苏州研究所业务覆盖</span></span><span>ICT</span><span><span>领域、智能汽车、半导体、华为云等多个关键产业。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>三</span></span><span>、招募对象</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>爱党爱国、诚实守信、学风端正、身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span><span><span>能够</span></span><span>取得推荐免试研究生（简称推免生）资格。</span></span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span><span><span>就读国内高水平高校，有志攻读电子信息、机械、材料与化工、能源动力、土木水利专业类</span><span><span>博士</span></span><span>研究生的</span></span></span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>四</span></span><span>、报名流程</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span>报名方式：填写以下链接线上报名，链接地址：</span><a href=\"https://hitsuzhou.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcnZlUbuT8p6qBKQwQxBnZDSb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://hitsuzhou.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcnZlUbuT8p6qBKQwQxBnZDSb</span></a></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/5c/62/34c0768447a5b67e9ca1c471d662/23ff29b8-cb11-48db-a294-5e903d0b5e77.png\"/></p><p><span>报名二维码</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>报名时间：</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日至</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span><span><span>日</span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>报名材料：</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）个人简历（一页）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的最新的成绩排名证明原件的扫描件（原件备查），其中证明内容须注明该排名对应的学期数及所在专业总人数；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单原件的扫描件（原件备查）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）报考学科相关领域的教授（或相当专业技术职称专家）的推荐信（下载链接</span><a href=\"http://yzb.hit.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/20/8d/41fe34e646ebafe4f85fa3bf0dfb/58f7500e-03b9-4045-9893-a1d7df204774.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://yzb.hit.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/20/8d/41fe34e646ebafe4f85fa3bf0dfb/58f7500e-03b9-4045-9893-a1d7df204774.doc</span></a><span>）两封；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）其他证明材料，如已发表的学术文章全文、本科期间各类获奖证书、体现英语水平的证明材料等。</span></p><p><span>注：以上材料原件在入营时审核。</span></p><p><span>以上所有材料按顺序合并成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span><span><span>文档，以</span><span>“</span><span>本科学校名称</span></span></span><span>-</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span><span><span>预报名专业的序号</span><span>”</span><span>格式命名，如</span><span>“</span></span></span><span>xx</span><span>大学</span><span>-</span><span>张</span><span>xx-1”</span><span>，并上传至报名表单链接。如文件上传失败，请发送至邮箱：</span><span>suzhou@hit.edu.cn</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>预报名专业的序号为：</span><span>1.</span><span>电子信息；</span><span>2.</span><span>机械；</span><span>3.</span><span>材料与化工；</span><span>4.</span><span>能源动力；</span><span>5</span><span>.</span><span>土木水利。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>确定名单：</span></p><p><span><span><span>研究院将根据申报情况，确定入</span><span><span>营</span></span><span>名单，并预计于</span></span></span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span><span><span><span>日前</span></span><span>通过邮件或电话的方式通知夏令营入</span><span><span>营</span></span><span>者。（届时未接到通知的同学皆为未入</span><span><span>营</span></span><span>者，不再另行通知）</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>五</span></span><span>、活动安排</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span>活动时间：</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>21-22</span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span>（具体安排另行通知）</span></span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>活动地点：哈工大苏州研究院</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span><span>活动内容：研究院介绍、</span><span><span>学术</span></span><span>报告、</span><span><span>学术</span></span><span>工作坊</span><span><span>、</span></span><span>合作单位参观。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>六、其他说明</span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>夏令营活动期间学生人身及财产安全由本人负责。请营员务必遵守国家的法律法规，遵守哈尔滨工业大学有关规章制度，按照夏令营统一安排与计划活动，严禁擅自离队。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>夏令营不收取任何费用。研究院会安排夏令营活动期间营员的用餐，不提供住宿、往返交通及其它费用。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>具体政策以学校当年的文件为准。</span></span></p><p><span>研究院联系人，杨老师，</span><span>0512-66528060/66528069</span><span>。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>哈工大苏州研究院</span><span></span></span></span></p><p><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"8546527afa86e4f0e1692ef70b248c3c0bf00d8af04032371bbf577e1011d2b5","textLength":1702,"sourceSha256":"0f76f71fcc5a62a9290c14d2303149fc9d2b110eea945a2c6feb70075fc5e00f","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f01ff35ab0840e71152c","title":"2025年哈尔滨工业大学苏州研究院关于举办2025年 “学术前沿探索”暑期夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:20.183096+00:00"}
